{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.juri.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "街上有个金发的女孩子",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.juri.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.juri.first",
    "idolId": "juri",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "我要怎么样，跟你没关系吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，不，不是那个意思……不如说，我觉得是很漂亮的颜色。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "什……",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。果然很适合你。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "哈、哈啊……！？你这人，突然干什么啊……？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，自我介绍晚了抱歉。其实我是做偶像制作人的。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以，如果可以的话，我想挖你当偶像。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "挖……你是说想让我当偶像？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。刚才一眼看到就觉得——你的话，绝对能成为很厉害的偶像。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "怎么样？要不要和我一起，以偶像为目标？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "不、不不不！我当偶像什么的，开玩笑吧！？",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……话说你这家伙。该不会是在拿我寻开心吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶……？寻开心，什么意思？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "那还用说。我看起来像当偶像的料吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "这头发，打扮也不像女孩子，嘴还这样，说话也不好听……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "这样还被说适合当偶像，让我信，这才不讲理吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没有那种事。气氛和说话方式，也是一种个性。不如说作为偶像很有魅力。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "哼……魅力，是吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她不说话了……是不是一下子说太多，把她吓到了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……西城樹里。叫我樹里就行。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……既然你都说到这个份上了，就把我变得像个偶像试试看吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "不过，我可不打算改变我自己的做法。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！嗯，今后请多指教，樹里！"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（人流量大的地方……嗯？）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（那个孩子，总感觉和别的孩子气氛不太一样。只是一个人走着，却有种特别的风格……）",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（简直像一头孤高的狼啊……）",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "喂，你，能稍微打扰一下吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，等一下……那边的你，等一下！",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "嗯？我……？",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，是啊。你的那个头发——",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "哈？干什么啊你，是不喜欢我染头发吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
